    "body": "I now feel like I misinterpreted the original request here: this is asking to drop the user activation requirement if [Document.fullscreenElement](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/fullscreenElement) is not null.\r\n\r\nFYI for @bradtriebwasser @michaelwasserman.",
