    "body": "Indeed, see supportive statements in this [related comment thread](https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/pull/153#issuecomment-1315231480) on the PR adding user activation consumption to requestFullscreen.\r\n\r\nIMO, it seems totally reasonable to grant fullscreen element changes without user activation.\r\nWhether or not we'd allow fullscreen display changes without user activation is less straightforward.\r\nThe [original Chromium bug](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1218483) was fixed by [adding support](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1293083) for [fullscreen capability delegation](https://chromestatus.com/feature/6441688242323456)",
    "author_association": "NONE",
